---
title: LexAid — Sequence Diagram (Query Flow)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 👤 User
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(Next.js 14)
    participant BE as Backend<br/>(FastAPI)
    participant CD as ChromaDB
    participant GQ as Groq API

    U->>FE: Type question<br/>(or select Triage category)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/query<br/>{question, category}

    Note over BE: Auto-detect category<br/>if not provided

    BE->>BE: Embed query<br/>"query: {text}"
    BE->>CD: query(embedding, top_k=8,<br/>where={category})
    CD-->>BE: chunks[] + distances[]

    Note over BE: Build context from<br/>top-8 statute chunks

    BE->>GQ: stream(system_prompt +<br/>context + question,<br/>temp=0.1, max_tokens=2048)

    BE-->>FE: SSE event: sources<br/>[act names]
    FE-->>U: Show source badges

    loop Token streaming
        GQ-->>BE: delta token
        BE-->>FE: SSE event: token
        FE-->>U: Append to chat bubble
    end

    GQ-->>BE: stream complete
    BE-->>FE: SSE event: done<br/>{chunks with scores}
    FE-->>U: Render full Markdown<br/>+ citation badges

    Note over U,FE: react-markdown + remark-gfm<br/>renders tables, bold, lists
